<title>UK: European cotton markets quiet, lack inquiry.</title>
<headline>European cotton markets quiet, lack inquiry.</headline>
<dateline>LIVERPOOL 1997-07-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>Spinner inquiry failed to improve in a market awaiting direction from US futures, although some modest business was under discussion in Portugal, Italy and Spain in selected medium/better qualities available for immediate delivery.</p>
<p>Eastern Europe lacked feature and long staple varieties were again neglected.</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7729</p>
